# SuperJackpotOneWayControl: s_oneway5 steps 25,000 / 75,000 / 100,000 / 125,000 / 150,000 (then 150,000 again), +200,000 super jackpot each, text 3076, sound tabc20wave (loader sound index from a native run).
init window 960 666
init fixed_dt 10
init seed 1
init watch super_jackpot
10 key down new_game
